0..75 Comment "//! Factorial by recursion and by iteration agree, and a factorial is even."
76..79 Comment "//!"
80..157 Comment "//! Grégoire and Leroy time factorial on unary naturals, its parity, and two"
158..235 Comment "//! factorial terms with one normal form. The parity reads back one constant,"
236..264 Comment "//! so the run dominates it."
265..268 Comment "//!"
269..350 Comment "//! One path compares the recursive and the iterative factorial of six. The other"
351..397 Comment "//! states that the factorial of five is even."
398..401 Comment "//!"
402..482 Comment "//! - cites: [Gregoire-2002-a_compiled_implementation_of_strong_reduction], § 6"
483..521 Comment "//! - see: #2282 — the benchmark set"
522..525 Comment "//!"
526..699 Comment "//! [Gregoire-2002-a_compiled_implementation_of_strong_reduction]: https://doi.org/10.1145/581478.581501 \"Grégoire and Leroy, A compiled implementation of strong reduction\""
